      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甜点可以让人忘记彼此之间的差异，一同欢笑。\n……所以，我很喜欢做甜点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ed73acd1e6fe2f4e38ba4fed152a791531e55f3f8761df442e84c342fb546d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
